sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant Browser as Admin Browser
    participant Filter as Security & CSRF Filters
    participant AdminServlet as AdminServlet
    participant ResSvc as ResourceService
    participant Val as FileValidator (MIME & Extension)
    participant Disk as Local File Storage (Outside Web Root)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16
    participant Audit as AuditService

    Admin->>Browser: Submits Upload Form (Title, Subject, Category, File Part)
    Browser->>Filter: POST /admin/resources/create (multipart/form-data)
    Filter->>AdminServlet: Validate Session & CSRF
    AdminServlet->>ResSvc: createResource(ResourceCreateDto, Part filePart)
    
    ResSvc->>Val: validateFile(filePart)
    Note over Val: Checks: 1. Magic byte MIME type<br/>2. Allowed extension (.pdf, .png, etc.)<br/>3. File size <= 50MB<br/>4. Anti-traversal check on filename
    Val-->>ResSvc: File Validation Passed

    ResSvc->>ResSvc: Generate UUID storage key (e.g., 3f9a8...a1b.pdf)
    ResSvc->>ResSvc: Resolve target dir: C:/StudyMate/storage/uploads/YYYY/MM/
    ResSvc->>Disk: Stream file chunks from Part to disk file
    Disk-->>ResSvc: Saved (Size: 4.8MB, SHA-256: e3b0c442...)

    ResSvc->>DB: Begin Transaction
    ResSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO resources (title, description, subject_id, category_id, uploader_id)
    DB-->>ResSvc: Generated resource_id = 101
    ResSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO resource_files (resource_id, file_name, file_path, file_size, mime_type, storage_type)
    ResSvc->>DB: Commit Transaction

    ResSvc->>Audit: logActivity(uploaderId, "RESOURCE_UPLOAD", "ID: 101", ip)
    Audit->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs

    ResSvc-->>AdminServlet: ResourceCreatedResponse(id=101)
    AdminServlet-->>Browser: Redirect to /admin/resources with success alert

